  "details": "Whenever I load into an instance with more than 10-15 avatars shown, my entire internet is killed locally only my PC on my network for about 30 seconds to a minute, or sometimes just killing my net entirely until I restart my PC.\nI am able to replicate this in any instance with several friends or shown avatars, and happens at least once a night on accident just by world hopping.\nThis issue also seems to happen when periods of high downloading or streaming, and only happens when playing VRChat. \nI understand hiding avatars is a workaround to solving this issue. but it is clearly not the appropriate fix as it requires me to consistently show/hide avatars if I wish to see them.\nI have taken basic steps such as windows updates, updating drivers, re-installing VRChat and clearing the cache, but it still happens consistently.",
